<title>USA: Nyer Medical Year 96 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Nyer Medical Year 96 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>BANGOR, Maine 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 Months</p>
<p>							 Ended December 31,</p>
<p>							1996	   1995</p>
<p> Net Sales				  $21,093,488   $9,046,018</p>
<p> Net (loss)				  ( 418,811)   ( 585,269)</p>
<p>Net (loss)</p>
<p>  per common share			     ( .14)	 ( .29)</p>
<p>Weighted average shares of common</p>
<p>  stock outstanding			 2,974,789    2,021,495</p>
<p>Record Sales Increase 133%</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said that the loss in 1996 stemmed primarily from a loss of $357,585 was sustained by Genetic Vectors Inc which completed its initial public offering in December 1996.  Nyer Medical was not immediately available to further comment on the Genetic Vectors transaction.</p>
</text>
